        "listed_on": "2026-11-19T00:00:00Z",
        "label": "Change how long deleted files are kept",
        "job": "Change how many days this person's Recently Deleted or Archived keep things before they move on",
        "description": "after_days is { state: days } (a whole number from 0 to 36500, or null to keep until put back). It applies at once to everything already there, so a shorter time can make things move on, or be gone for good, at the next sweep. A state left out keeps its days. Your AI reads your setting:keep_for and hands it in as stored; the answer's keep is the new setting for it to keep. Answers the keep-for now in force: states (each with its id, label, after_days, default_after_days and what happens when its time ends) and choices.",
